	(descr "Wurth Elektronik 750313355 WE-PoE++ PoE forward transformer, EFD20 SMT, 12 gull-wing pins. GEOMETRY REBUILT Task 14b from Wurth's own datasheet Recommended Land Pattern (we-online.com/components/products/datasheet/750313355.pdf, rev 004.001 2025-03-12): pads 3.05x1.27mm, 3.00mm pitch, 6 per column, column centers 26.52mm apart; pin 1 top-left, 1-6 down the left column, 12-7 down the right (per datasheet pin-position view: 1/12 top, 6/7 bottom). Replaces the Task-14 approximation (6+6 pins on TOP/BOTTOM edges at 5.06mm pitch, 19.0mm row separation, 2.5x1.6 pads -- wrong axis, wrong pitch, wrong span; would not fit the physical part). Body max 21.8mm across lead axis, lead span 29.65 max, height 11.43 max (datasheet dimension view). Body Y-outline/courtyard cosmetic (bobbin length not explicitly dimensioned; 16.6mm drawn). 3D model: dimensioned envelope box (21.8x16.6x11.43mm), not a detailed body.")
